From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: size tiles for Display, Text and Lock screen

Settings > Display, under Accent, shows three size choices as rows of
"A" tiles, small to large (owner pick from the BB10 size picker):

- Display size: Smaller, Small, Default, Large, Larger (0.86 to 1.14
  times the panel's density; on the Q25 241, 260, 280, 300, 319 dpi).
  Default clears the forced density; the others force it for the
  current user through IWindowManager, as Display size and text does.
- Text size (1601): the same four font scales, now as tiles.
- Lock screen size: Small, Default, Large, Larger in Settings.Secure
  sable_lock_screen_size, which SystemUI's compact PIN pad and locked
  glance read (frameworks/base 0315).

Each tile takes focus from the trackpad or arrow keys and is chosen
with Enter, Space or a tap; TalkBack reads "Large, selected". A value
set elsewhere selects no tile and is named as custom. Pure steps in
sable/SableSizes.
